CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1788967116
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AChannel 4 to cut 340 jobs by the end of
OL,4,Athe year in major shake-up
OL,5,
OL,6,FPriya Dogra, Channel 4's chief
OL,7,Fexecutive, said the announcement "marks
OL,8,Fthe first phase of our transformation,
OL,9,Fensuring Channel 4 is the right shape
OL,10,Fand size to deliver its future strategy
OL,11,Fand focus investment in the programmes
OL,12,Faudiences love".
OL,14,FCaroline Dinenage, chair of the
OL,15,Fculture, media and sport committee said
OL,16,Fthe news would be "deeply worrying for
OL,17,Fthe talented and dedicated people who
OL,18,Fwork at Channel 4".
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
